{title: Do Pal}
{artist: Meera Sood}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Main Am bas Do pa[F]l ruk jaaun
[C]Ab na jaane kab tak [G]yahan hoon
[Am]E dil Na maane, Hai [F]yeh kahaani
[C]Tu hi bata de, [G]kya hai nishaa[Am]ni
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[F]Do pal, bas do p[C]al
[G]Main tera, tu meri[Am], aaj kal
[F]Do pal, bas do p[C]al
[G]Ab A ki baari, B ka [Am]sawaal
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
Main Am bas Do pal
Ab Na Hai Tu Me
E Am bas Ab Do
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Bas Do kadam aur c[F]halna hai
[C]Main bhi wahi hoon, [G]tu bhi wahi hai
[Am]Ek A se Z tak likha t[F]ha
[C]Ab pal pal Do p[G]al mein bikh[Am]a tha
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[F]Do pal, bas do p[C]al
[G]Main tera, tu meri[Am], aaj kal
[F]Do pal, bas do p[C]al
[G]Ab A ki baari, B ka [Am]sawaal
{end_of_verse}
